<h1>Third-party licenses</h1>
<p>Noura is MIT licensed. It includes the fonts, icons and open source crates below, under the licenses that follow. The plugins that ship with Noura also include wit-bindgen 0.63, under Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception, Apache-2.0 or MIT.</p>
<h2 id="bundled">Fonts and icons</h2>
<p>Noura draws its interface in Public Sans 5.3.0 from <code>@fontsource-variable/public-sans</code>, under the SIL Open Font License 1.1, and its icons from Phosphor's path data in <code>phosphor-svelte</code> 3.1.0, under the MIT License.</p>
